Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.1.34-rt39 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.1.34 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.1-rt
  Head SHA1: 91a4c98c58d2d68ba24a4c1d536a619fffc7166b


Or to build 4.1.34-rt39 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/linux-4.1.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/patch-4.1.34.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.1/patch-4.1.34-rt39.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
